# 277_TOPIC_max_length_line_boundary_510.spec
# Tests TOPIC with maximum allowed IRC input line boundary (exactly 510 characters before \r\n).
# Expected: Server accepts the line without dropping or crashing and stores topic properly.
CLIENTS C1

C1 SEND PASS 1234
C1 SEND NICK Ali378
C1 SEND USER ali378 0 * :Ali378
C1 EXPECT 001 Ali378 :*
C1 SEND JOIN #boundary
C1 EXPECT :Ali378!* JOIN #boundary
C1 EXPECT 331 Ali378 #boundary :*
C1 EXPECT 353 Ali378 = #boundary :*
C1 EXPECT 366 Ali378 #boundary :*

# Payload of 493 characters + command header (17 chars) = exactly 510 chars (exceeds topic length limit of 150)
C1 SEND TOPIC #boundary :
C1 EXPECT 461 Ali378 TOPIC :Topic length is too long
